statement:
Let P, n ∈ ℕ and let U ⊆ ℝ^P be open. Assume:
- S : ℕ → GeometricCurrentOn U n and S₀ ∈ GeometricCurrentOn U n satisfy sup_q M_W(S_q) < ∞ for every W with CompactlyContainedOpen W U, and S_q ⇀ S₀ (WeaklyConvergesOn S S₀);
- ω : ℝ^P → Covector (Eucl P) n is continuous with compact support and tsupport ω ⊆ U;
- μ_q, μ₀ are measures and v_q, v₀ : ℝ^P → NVector (Eucl P) n are maps with IsMeasureRepresentation (S q) (μ q) (v q) for all q and IsMeasureRepresentation S₀ μ₀ v₀.
Then ∫ v_q(x)(ω(x)) dμ_q(x) → ∫ v₀(x)(ω(x)) dμ₀(x) as q → ∞.
